;: iobout.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: I/O block outputs
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk LC
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A G:B DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Equate G = B
Endblk
Editblk AK
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A G:B DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ~A
Equate G = B
Endblk
Editblk P13
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P57
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P16
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P17
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ:FAST TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P35
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ:OKNOT TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P33
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O:NOT TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P34
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O:FAST TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P39
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:T
Endblk
Editblk P40
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:T:NOT
Endblk
Editblk P75
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P76
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P77
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P78
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Addnet GPAD TCLKIN.I GCLK.I
Addnet APAD BCLKIN.I ACLK.I
Addnet GK GCLK.O P16.OK P17.OK
Addnet AK ACLK.O P35.OK
Addnet I0 P75.I LC.A AK.A
Addnet I1 P76.I LC.B AK.B
Addnet I2 P77.I P39.T P40.T
Addnet I3 P78.I P16.O P17.O
Addnet O0 LC.X P35.O P33.O
Addnet O1 LC.Y P34.O
Addnet O2 AK.X P39.O
Addnet O3 AK.Y P40.O
